flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Locate pract.txt and set report path]
    B --> C{Does pract.txt exist?}
    C -- No --> D[Print error]
    D --> Z([Exit])
    C -- Yes --> E[Compile CAN log pattern]
    E --> F[Initialize messages grouped by CAN ID]
    F --> G[Read log line]
    G --> H{More lines?}
    H -- Yes --> I{Line matches pattern?}
    I -- No --> G
    I -- Yes --> J[Parse timestamp, CAN ID, DLC, and data bytes]
    J --> K{Data bytes valid hex?}
    K -- No --> G
    K -- Yes --> L[Add frame to messages for its CAN ID]
    L --> G
    H -- No --> M[Create report and write totals]
    M --> N[Write sorted CAN ID summary]
    N --> O{More CAN IDs?}
    O -- Yes --> P[Write ID heading and occurrence count]
    P --> Q[Calculate and write DLC distribution]
    Q --> R{More than one frame?}
    R -- Yes --> S[Calculate and write cycle-time statistics]
    R -- No --> T[Analyze bytes]
    S --> T
    T --> U[For each byte position, collect values]
    U --> V{Only one unique value?}
    V -- Yes --> W[Write constant value]
    V -- No --> X[Write min, max, unique count, and counter score]
    X --> Y{Counter score over 80%?}
    Y -- Yes --> AA[Write possible rolling counter]
    Y -- No --> AB[Write up to five sample frames]
    W --> AB
    AA --> AB
    AB --> O
    O -- No --> AC[Close report]
    AC --> AD[Print completion and report path]
    AD --> Z
